    {
      "title": "Ask HN: Should we shut down current AI strategy? Vent Your Heart Out",
      "summary": "I don't know, maybe it's just me. Does it feel to you like we're boiling the oceans in a desperate attempt to build something \"smarter than human?\" Do you notice that the idea that \"AI will cure cancer\" is predicated on the belief that we've found the data that will lead to a cure and us humans just somehow missed it? Are you also watching your former boss, who laid you off for AI, slowly turn the nail gun that is AI automation towards his own face? Are you also currently avoiding plane flights at all costs? Personally, I like AI a lot, but I think conversational language models were a mistake. Isn't this the root of AI psychosis for most? Isn't autocomplete turned conversational just sycophancy for our delusions even if we have guardrails in place? Don't you think that if you can't explain the functionality of an AI model that means you probably shouldn't use it? If you said yes to any of the above I'd love to hear your thoughts on the current state of things. Please, vent your heart out. If you said no to everything please just be quiet, this will be fun for the rest of us.",
      "summary_html": "<p>I don't know, maybe it's just me.<p>Does it feel to you like we're boiling the oceans in a desperate attempt to build something \"smarter than human?\"<p>Do you notice that the idea that \"AI will cure cancer\" is predicated on the belief that we've found the data that will lead to a cure and us humans just somehow missed it?<p>Are you also watching your former boss, who laid you off for AI, slowly turn the nail gun that is AI automation towards his own face?<p>Are you also currently avoiding plane flights at all costs?<p>Personally, I like AI a lot, but I think conversational language models were a mistake. Isn't this the root of AI psychosis for most? Isn't autocomplete turned conversational just sycophancy for our delusions even if we have guardrails in place?<p>Don't you think that if you can't explain the functionality of an AI model that means you probably shouldn't use it?<p>If you said yes to any of the above I'd love to hear your thoughts on the current state of things. Please, vent your heart out.<p>If you said no to everything please just be quiet, this will be fun for the rest of us.</p>\n\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50542654\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50542654</a></p>\n<p>Points: 3</p>\n<p># Comments: 4</p></p></p></p></p></p></p></p></p>",
      "link": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50542654",
